      "type": "frame",
      "id": "sksyE",
      "x": 87,
      "y": 15609,
      "name": "MOBILE / 08 Progress",
      "context": "Populated Progress state. View all 310 questions opens the full list, row selection opens history detail, and Study this question starts study at that source question. First use: 310 Not started, 0 Needs review, 0 Learning, 0 Learned; no attempt rows or mock history, with Study all questions as the first action. A blank mock answer does not create a question attempt. Full-page mobile specification at 390 px. At a normal viewport, the 58 px header and 86 px bottom bar remain visible while content scrolls; preserve a safe-area inset and make the last action reachable. Canvas height expands to show all content. Learning status follows chronological attempts: Not started (gray), Needs review after any wrong answer (red), Learning after one consecutive correct answer (orange), Learned after two or more (green). Wrong answers reset the streak. Study and completed mock tests share history; blanks, unfinished tests and session feedback resets do not change status. Learning and Learned each contribute once to progress. Each question accepts one answer per study session. No Retry question action. Previous and Next retain current-session answers and feedback. Entering Study again or opening a question from a learning-status filter in Progress starts a fresh session. Leaving study, changing mode or group, reloading, or restarting a completed pass clears session answers, but preserves positions, attempt history, learning status and progress.",
