      "context": "Full 310-question list with progressive loading. This frame shows the first eight entries; Show more reveals the next eight without losing filters. Selecting a row opens Question history. Returning preserves filter and list position. Full-page mobile specification at 390 px. At a normal viewport, the 58 px header and 86 px bottom bar remain visible while content scrolls; preserve a safe-area inset and make the last action reachable. Canvas height expands to show all content. Learning status follows chronological attempts: Not started (gray), Needs review after any wrong answer (red), Learning after one consecutive correct answer (orange), Learned after two or more (green). Wrong answers reset the streak. Study and completed mock tests share history; blanks, unfinished tests and session feedback resets do not change status. Learning and Learned each contribute once to progress. Each question accepts one answer per study session. No Retry question action. Previous and Next retain current-session answers and feedback. Entering Study again or opening a question from a learning-status filter in Progress starts a fresh session. Leaving study, changing mode or group, reloading, or restarting a completed pass clears session answers, but preserves positions, attempt history, learning status and progress.",
